{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:79ded6bc2b875a6a","name":"Targeting Laser","source":{"id":"source:reference-79ded6bc2b875a6a","title":"Targeting Laser","revision":20969,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:53:51Z","sha256":"263583134165f38c36e77a817828b968f9c7241b74f24887b1d4f5bbf5452bea","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20969","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Targeting%20Laser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-79ded6bc2b875a6a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This tiny laser is used to paint targets with a beam of light to guide missiles, bombardment attacks, or other incoming fire, but it otherwise deals no damage. The laser is tunable through a broad spectrum, allowing the attacker to home in on a specific Targeting Laser in the otherwise chaotic jumble of battlefield laser fire.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To use a Targeting Laser, the wielder makes an attack roll, ignoring any Armor bonuses to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". As long as the wielder repeats the attack each round, any ally who knows the frequency of the Targeting Laser gains a +2 bonus to attack rolls when attacking the target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missile Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missile_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:f5c813188b5889e5"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:da6a8268b875d982"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapon"},". A Targeting Laser can be used by hand or mounted on any Medium or larger weapon, and requires an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:8456b42e685346fd"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 50\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.1 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
